────────────────────
_ do prepared-rule Bool
    - id SyntaxId
    - outer U32
    - within SyntaxId

` Whether a rule a style rule applies, by the application `outer`, is one the reference prepares
` as it prepares the markup element `id` whose rules are being applied (`preparing.site`), before
` its object is made (`nestedRuleScopesForPrepared`): one written after the name of a rule the
` element applies, or after that of one so prepared, but not in the body of a `when`.
