= runtime.imperative != no-instance && runtime.imperative-object != no-instance

────────────────────
_ do style-read-ready Bool
    - type TypeId

` Whether a value of a style property's type is read back from its bits: a number or a truth as
` it is, and a handle by the runtime's `style-object-pointer`, to the object it holds or the box
` of a value. A union nested in a union has no shape here.
