+ do sheet-parts [DeclRef]
    - ref DeclRef

` The declarations whose members a class has: a class's own, then each facet bound to it in the
` order of its facets; those of a style sheet are the sheet's, then each extension of it the
` program declares (`• extend Name`), as the reference declares them into the sheet: in the order
` the modules are declared and, in one, in the order written.
