= (false, true)

────────────────────
_ do repeats-rule Bool
    - earlier SyntaxId
    - args RowRange'SyntaxId

` Whether an earlier rule of the same name takes what `args` takes, as `same-signature` tells.
` One whose types are written in a way not named here is declined.
do match? tree.nodes[earlier]
    | .node-rule-syntax(row)
        . (same, known) = same-signature(tree, row.args, tree, args)
        if !known
